{"id":"77d2ef3450d9750f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-ultraproduct.md","title":"Ultraproduct","display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-ultraproduct","aliases":["93-df-ultraproduct"],"display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","depends_on":["[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-ultraproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-ultraproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> is nonempty, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span> is the exact ultrafilter predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\\)</span> is the direct-product constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\)</span> is the explicitly indexed direct product, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-indexed quotient constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\n\\bigl|\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\bigr|^2:\n\\{i\\in I:a(i)=b(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\n\\bigl|\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\bigr|^2:\n\\{i\\in I:a(i)=b(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau),\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau);\\tau\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau),\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau);\\tau\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}\\bigl(\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}\\bigl(\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The constructor is the explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-quotient of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-indexed product. The factor family is a function graph <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\)</span>, and the congruence, auxiliary product, index set, ultrafilter, and type are all explicit constructor data.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7cc13e0d91069bbd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7cc13e0d91069bbd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\in V$ is nonempty, $\\mathbf A:I\\to V$, $\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$ is the exact ultrafilter predicate of [[93-df-set-ultrafilter]], and $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))$ for every $i\\in I$.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}$ is the direct-product constructor of [[93-df-product]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}$ is the type-indexed quotient constructor of [[93-df-quotient-algebra]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\n\\bigl|\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\bigr|^2:\n\\{i\\in I:a(i)=b(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau),\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau);\\tau\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\Theta_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}\\bigl(\\mathbf P_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A:I\\to V","display":false}],"bytes":2159,"backlinks":[{"id":"2cd98554615471be","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-finite-algebra]], [[93-df-cardinality]], and [[93-df-ultraproduct]]."},{"id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(-,-;I,\\tau)$ and $\\mathrm{Ultra}$ are the constructor and predicate of [[93-df-ultraproduct]] and [[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8812becc0adfe44f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"27d9efd53f614967","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf A:I\\to V$ is a family in $\\mathcal V$ and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ is the constructor of [[93-df-ultraproduct]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-36","lo